he following criteria:"]},{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["It is after NU7 activation height."]},{"tag":"li","children":["It is calculated to be the lowest height after the second halving at which the NSM issuance would be less than the current BTC-style issuance ",{"tag":"em","children":["neglecting"]}," any ZEC removed from circulation (i.e. assuming the amount of ZEC removed from circulation is exactly 0)."]}]},{"tag":"h3","children":["Issuance Calculation"],"id":"issuancecalculation"},{"tag":"p","children":["At the ",{"tag":"math","children":[{"tag":"mrow","children":[{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖣"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖤"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖯"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖫"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖮"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖸"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖬"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖤"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖭"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖳"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["_"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖡"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖫"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖮"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖢"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖪"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["_"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖧"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖤"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖨"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖦"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖧"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖳"]}]}]},", nodes MUST switch from the current issuance calculation, to the following:"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"math","children":[{"tag":"mrow","children":[{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖡"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗅"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗈"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖼"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗄"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖲"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗎"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖻"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗌"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗂"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖽"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗒"]}]},{"tag":"mo","children":["("],"attrs":{"stretchy":"false"}},{"tag":"mrow","children":[{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗁"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖾"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗂"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗀"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗁"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗍"]}]},{"tag":"mo","children":[")"],"attrs":{"stretchy":"false"}},{"tag":"mo","children":["="]},{"tag":"mrow","children":[{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖼"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖾"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗂"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗅"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗂"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗇"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗀"]}]},{"tag":"mo","children":["("],"attrs":{"stretchy":"false"}},{"tag":"mrow","children":[{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖡"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖫"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖮"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖢"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖪"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["_"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖲"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖴"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖡"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖲"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖨"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖣"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖸"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["_"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖥"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖱"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖠"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖢"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖳"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖨"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖮"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖭"]}]},{"tag":"mo","children":["⋅"]},{"tag":"mrow","children":[{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖬"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗈"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗇"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖾"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗒"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖱"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖾"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗌"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖾"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗋"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗏"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖾"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖠"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖿"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗍"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖾"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗋"]}]},{"tag":"mo","children":["("],"attrs":{"stretchy":"false"}},{"tag":"mrow","children":[{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗁"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖾"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗂"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗀"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗁"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗍"]}]},{"tag":"mo","children":["−"]},{"tag":"mn","children":["1"]},{"tag":"mo","children":[")"],"attrs":{"stretchy":"false"}},{"tag":"mo","children":[")"],"attrs":{"stretchy":"false"}}]}]},{"tag":"h3","children":["Applicability"],"id":"applicability"},{"tag":"p","children":["All of these changes apply identically to Mainnet and Testnet."]},{"tag":"h2","children":["Rationale"],"id":"rationale"},{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["Using an exponential decay function satisfies ",{"tag":"strong","children":["Requirements 1"]}," and ",{"tag":"strong","children":["2"]}," above."]},{"tag":"li","children":["We round up to the next zatoshi to satisfy ",{"tag":"strong","children":["Requirement 3"]}," above."]},{"tag":"li","children":["The issuance formula depends only on ",{"tag":"code","children":["MoneyReserveAfter(height - 1)"]}," and a single constant fraction, making it simple to implement, explain, and verify."]}]},{"tag":"h3","children":["Parameters"],"id":"parameters-1"},{"tag":"p","children":["The selection is intended to achieve Key Objective 6 while still being at a constant, predictable height. An alternative would be to have a dynamic “latch”-style activation, which would calculate the activation height by testing the “less than” conditional with every block after the second halving. We prefer the pre-defined constant height parameter, to give everyone more ",{"tag":"em","children":["time"]}," certainty at the cost of ",{"tag":"em","children":["issuance level"]}," certainty."]},{"tag":"p","children":["The difference in up-front calculation versus dynamic calculation is in whether or not funds removed from circulation are accounted for (since funds removed from circulation in the future cannot be calculated up-front). This means with the pre-defined constant parameter approach, issuance will jump ",{"tag":"em","children":["up"]}," some amount at activation. This amount should be equivalent to all ZEC removed from circulation prior to that height times ",{"tag":"math","children":[{"tag":"mrow","children":[{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖡"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖫"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖮"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖢"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖪"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["_"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖲"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖴"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖡"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖲"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖨"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖣"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖸"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["_"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖥"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖱"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖠"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖢"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖳"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖨"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖮"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖭"]}]}]},". For example, if a total of 100,000 ZEC were removed from circulation prior to the pre-defined constant activation height, then at activation the issuance would be larger than BTC-style issuance by ",{"tag":"math","children":[{"tag":"mn","children":["100"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["_"]},{"tag":"mn","children":["000"]},{"tag":"mrow","children":[{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖹"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖤"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖢"]}]},{"tag":"mo","children":["⋅"]},{"tag":"mrow","children":[{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖡"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖫"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖮"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖢"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖪"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["_"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖲"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖴"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖡"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖲"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖨"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖣"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖸"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["_"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖥"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖱"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖠"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖢"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖳"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖨"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖮"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖭"]}]}]},", which we calculate equals ",{"tag":"math","children":[{"tag":"mn","children":["0.04126"]}]}," ZEC. This example is chosen to demonstrate that 